# Deckd rules

- V1 is pass-and-play only.
- Do not work on BLE, IAP, Rive, auth, analytics, or custom rules unless explicitly requested.
- Components live in `components/`; game logic in `src/engine/`; zustand stores in `src/store/`.
- Keep TypeScript strict. Avoid `any`.
- Use `src/lib/theme.ts` for colors/tokens.
- Do not hand-edit generated native folders.
- Run `npm run typecheck`, `npm run lint`, and `npx expo-doctor` before handoff.
